<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul>
    <li><b>Prices no longer freeze</b> — fixed a bug where live prices could stop updating after your Mac woke from sleep or after the app had been running for a long time. StockDock now detects a stalled connection and reconnects automatically.</li>
    <li><b>Correct price outside market hours</b> — with extended hours turned off, prices now stay on the last regular close during pre-market and after-hours instead of briefly showing the extended-hours price.</li>
</ul>
